flowchart LR
    Spec[Public typed workload<br/>shapes, constants, ranges, allowed outputs] --> Compiler[Validate and lower graph]
    Compiler --> Reference[Client plaintext reference]
    Compiler --> Search[Bounded deployment planner<br/>layout, key basis, sharing, schedule]
    Costs[Public development measurements<br/>setup, bytes, operations, memory] --> Search
    Budget[Request horizon and resource limits] --> Search
    Search --> Plan[Versioned compiled plan]
    subgraph Client[Client trust boundary]
        Keygen[OpenFHE key generation] --> Secret[Secret key stays here]
        Inputs[Private values] --> Encrypt[Range check and encrypt]
        Keygen --> Encrypt
        Decrypt[Bind response and decrypt] --> Answers[Allowed numerical outputs]
        Secret --> Decrypt
        Reference --> Check[Three-path numerical check]
        Answers --> Check
    end
    subgraph Server[Honest-but-curious evaluator]
        Auth[Authenticate owner / program / epoch] --> Native[Fresh bounded native process]
        Native --> Mask[Full-slot output mask]
    end
    Plan --> Keygen
    Plan --> Native
    Keygen -->|Public context and evaluation keys| Native
    Encrypt -->|Authenticated ciphertext request| Auth
    Mask -->|Ciphertext response| Decrypt
